OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and windy start, with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, some short-lived
OL,7,Fheavy pulses possible. Cloud clears
OL,8,Fand wind eases by early afternoon,
OL,9,Fwith bright and sunny conditions to
OL,10,Ffollow. The odd shower developing
OL,11,Flater in the afternoon, across western
OL,12,Fparts.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA mix of clear and cloudy
OL,15,Fperiods overnight with light rain or
OL,16,Fshowers possible. Mist or fog patches
OL,17,Fforming by dawn in light wind. Feeling
OL,18,Fcooler compared to last night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
