OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FLargely clear start and end
OL,6,Fto the day, some cloud forming during
OL,7,Fthe afternoon but remaining dry for
OL,8,Fmost. Wind strengthening for a time.
OL,9,FRemaining slightly warmer than the
OL,10,Fnorm.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry
OL,13,FFriday morning, wet and windy for some
OL,14,Flater. Cloudy and possibly wet in
OL,15,Fplaces Saturday. Fog patches Sunday
OL,16,Fmorning, dry with variable amounts of
OL,17,Fcloud later. Above average
OL,18,Ftemperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
